@SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5217

### Health check
GET {{SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Readiness (includes the database)
GET {{SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Register (change the email each time)
# @name register
POST {{SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery staple",
  "displayName": "Your Name",
  "baseCurrency": "USD"
}

### Sign in
# @name login
POST {{SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery staple",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Who am I (uses the access token from "Sign in")
GET {{SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Get new tokens (the refresh token can be used once)
POST {{SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Sign out
POST {{SmartLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

###
